OL,3,GNEWSAPolice hope tattoos will unlock
OL,4,Adead man's identity
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have released images of tattoos
OL,7,Fon the body of a man who was discovered
OL,8,Fon a beach in East Sussex in an effort
OL,9,Fto identify him.
OL,11,FOfficers were called to Rottingdean
OL,12,Fbeach at about 09:40 BST on 11 October
OL,13,Fover concerns for the safety of a man
OL,14,Fwho was at the water's edge.
OL,16,FSussex Police said the man was
OL,17,Fpronounced dead at the scene, but more
OL,18,Fthan a month on, the force has still
OL,19,Fnot managed to confirm his identity.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
